msgid ""
"Parameter tables (Startup vs Runtime): [Controller ROS 2 "
"parameters](8-ros2_parameters.md). Machine YAML lives in "
"`{robot}_description/config/ros2_control/ros2_controllers.yaml` (there is"
" no in-tree `config/ocs2_arm_controller.yaml`). README package-specific "
"keys: `home_pos`, `rest_pos`, `robot_name`, `default_gains`, `pd_gains`, "
"frames, `movel_*`. Names that are **not** parameters: `zero_pos`, "
"`robot_pkg`, `force_gains`."
msgstr ""
"参数表（仅启动 vs 运行时）：[控制器 ROS 2 参数](8-ros2_parameters.md)。机型 YAML 在 "
"`{robot}_description/config/ros2_control/ros2_controllers.yaml`（树内没有 "
"`config/ocs2_arm_controller.yaml`）。README "
"包专有键：`home_pos`、`rest_pos`、`robot_name`、`default_gains`、`pd_gains`、坐标系、`movel_*`。**不是**参数的旧名：`zero_pos`、`robot_pkg`、`force_gains`。"

